#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:2
msgid "Custom IAM API Identity Source"
msgstr "Custom IAM API Identity Source"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Übersicht"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:7
msgid ""
"The Custom IAM API identity source allows |morpheus| to authenticate "
"users against an external Identity and Access Management (IAM) system "
"through a custom API endpoint. This is useful for organizations with "
"proprietary or uncommon IAM systems that provide a REST or HTTP-based "
"authentication API."
msgstr "Die Custom IAM API Identity Source ermöglicht |morpheus|, Benutzer über einen benutzerdefinierten API-Endpunkt gegen ein externes Identity and Access Management-(IAM)-System zu authentifizieren. Dies ist nützlich für Organisationen mit proprietären oder ungewöhnlichen IAM-Systemen, die eine REST- oder HTTP-basierte Authentifizierungs-API bereitstellen."

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:9
msgid ""
"|morpheus| sends user credentials to the configured endpoint and "
"processes the response to authenticate users and optionally assign roles."
msgstr "|morpheus| sendet Benutzeranmeldedaten an den konfigurierten Endpunkt und verarbeitet die Antwort, um Benutzer zu authentifizieren und optional Rollen zuzuweisen."

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:12
msgid "Adding a Custom IAM API Identity Source"
msgstr "Eine Custom IAM API Identity Source hinzufügen"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:14
msgid "Navigate to |AdmTen|"
msgstr "Navigieren Sie zu |AdmTen|"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:15
msgid "Select the Tenant to add the Identity Source Integration"
msgstr "Wählen Sie den Mandanten, dem die Identity Source Integration hinzugefügt werden soll"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:16
msgid "Select :guilabel:`IDENTITY SOURCES`"
msgstr "Wählen Sie :guilabel:`IDENTITY SOURCES`"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:17
msgid "Select :guilabel:`+ IDENTITY SOURCE`"
msgstr "Wählen Sie :guilabel:`+ IDENTITY SOURCE`"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:18
msgid "Select **Custom API** from the TYPE dropdown"
msgstr "Wählen Sie **Custom API** aus dem Dropdown TYPE"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:19
msgid "Enter the following:"
msgstr "Geben Sie Folgendes ein:"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:21
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NAME"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:22
msgid "A name for this Identity Source integration in |morpheus|."
msgstr "Ein Name für diese Identity Source Integration in |morpheus|."

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:24
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIPTION"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:25
msgid "Optional description of the Identity Source."
msgstr "Optionale Beschreibung der Identity Source."

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:27
msgid "API ENDPOINT"
msgstr "API ENDPOINT"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:28
msgid ""
"The full URL of the external IAM authentication API endpoint (e.g., "
"``https://iam.example.com/api/authenticate``)."
msgstr "Die vollständige URL des externen IAM-Authentifizierungs-API-Endpunkts (z. B. ``https://iam.example.com/api/authenticate``)."

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:30
msgid "API STYLE"
msgstr "API STYLE"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:31
msgid ""
"The HTTP method and encoding format for sending credentials to the "
"endpoint:"
msgstr "Die HTTP-Methode und das Encoding-Format zum Senden von Anmeldedaten an den Endpunkt:"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Form URL Encoded [GET]** — Credentials sent as URL query parameters via"
" GET request"
msgstr "**Form URL Encoded [GET]** — Anmeldedaten als URL-Query-Parameter per GET-Anfrage gesendet"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Form URL Encoded [POST]** — Credentials sent as form-encoded body via "
"POST request"
msgstr "**Form URL Encoded [POST]** — Anmeldedaten als form-codierter Body per POST-Anfrage gesendet"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:35
msgid "**JSON [POST]** — Credentials sent as JSON body via POST request"
msgstr "**JSON [POST]** — Anmeldedaten als JSON-Body per POST-Anfrage gesendet"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:36
msgid "**XML [POST]** — Credentials sent as XML body via POST request"
msgstr "**XML [POST]** — Anmeldedaten als XML-Body per POST-Anfrage gesendet"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:37
msgid ""
"**HTTP Basic [GET]** — Credentials sent via HTTP Basic Authentication "
"header on a GET request"
msgstr "**HTTP Basic [GET]** — Anmeldedaten über HTTP-Basic-Authentication-Header bei einer GET-Anfrage gesendet"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:39
msgid "VALUE ENCRYPTION ALGORITHM"
msgstr "VALUE ENCRYPTION ALGORITHM"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:40
msgid ""
"(Not available for HTTP Basic style) The algorithm used to encrypt "
"credential values before sending them to the API:"
msgstr "(Nicht verfügbar für HTTP-Basic-Style) Der Algorithmus zum Verschlüsseln von Anmeldedatenwerten vor dem Senden an die API:"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:42
msgid "**NONE** — Credentials sent in plaintext (use only with HTTPS)"
msgstr "**NONE** — Anmeldedaten im Klartext gesendet (nur mit HTTPS verwenden)"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:43
msgid "**AES** — Advanced Encryption Standard"
msgstr "**AES** — Advanced Encryption Standard"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:44
msgid "**DES** — Data Encryption Standard"
msgstr "**DES** — Data Encryption Standard"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:45
msgid "**DESede** — Triple DES"
msgstr "**DESede** — Triple DES"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:46
msgid "**HmacSHA1** — HMAC with SHA-1"
msgstr "**HmacSHA1** — HMAC with SHA-1"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:47
msgid "**HmacSHA256** — HMAC with SHA-256"
msgstr "**HmacSHA256** — HMAC with SHA-256"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:49
msgid "ENCRYPTION KEY"
msgstr "ENCRYPTION KEY"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:50
msgid ""
"(Required when an encryption algorithm other than NONE is selected) The "
"shared secret key used to encrypt credential values before transmission."
msgstr "(Erforderlich, wenn ein anderer Verschlüsselungsalgorithmus als NONE gewählt ist) Der gemeinsame Secret-Schlüssel zum Verschlüsseln von Anmeldedatenwerten vor der Übertragung."

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:52
msgid "DEFAULT MORPHEUS ROLE"
msgstr "DEFAULT MORPHEUS ROLE"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:53
msgid ""
"The default |morpheus| Role assigned to users authenticated through this "
"identity source. Select NONE to require explicit role mapping for all "
"users."
msgstr "Die Standard-|morpheus|-Rolle, die Benutzern zugewiesen wird, die über diese Identity Source authentifiziert werden. Wählen Sie NONE, um für alle Benutzer ein explizites Rollen-Mapping zu verlangen."

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:55
msgid "Select :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr "Wählen Sie :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:58
msgid "Authentication Flow"
msgstr "Authentifizierungsablauf"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:60
msgid "User enters credentials on the |morpheus| login page"
msgstr "Benutzer gibt Anmeldedaten auf der |morpheus|-Anmeldeseite ein"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:61
msgid "|morpheus| formats the credentials according to the configured API Style"
msgstr "|morpheus| formatiert die Anmeldedaten gemäß dem konfigurierten API Style"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:62
msgid ""
"If encryption is configured, credential values are encrypted with the "
"shared key"
msgstr "Wenn Verschlüsselung konfiguriert ist, werden Anmeldedatenwerte mit dem gemeinsamen Schlüssel verschlüsselt"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:63
msgid "|morpheus| sends the request to the configured API Endpoint"
msgstr "|morpheus| sendet die Anfrage an den konfigurierten API Endpoint"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:64
msgid ""
"The external IAM system validates credentials and returns a "
"success/failure response"
msgstr "Das externe IAM-System validiert die Anmeldedaten und gibt eine Erfolgs-/Fehlerantwort zurück"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:65
msgid ""
"On success, |morpheus| creates or updates the local user account and logs"
" the user in with the Default Role"
msgstr "Bei Erfolg erstellt oder aktualisiert |morpheus| das lokale Benutzerkonto und meldet den Benutzer mit der Default Role an"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:66
msgid "On failure, the login is denied with an authentication error"
msgstr "Bei Fehlschlag wird die Anmeldung mit einem Authentifizierungsfehler verweigert"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:69
msgid "API Response Expectations"
msgstr "API-Antwort-Erwartungen"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:71
msgid "The external IAM API endpoint should:"
msgstr "Der externe IAM-API-Endpunkt sollte:"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:73
msgid "Return an HTTP 200 status code on successful authentication"
msgstr "Einen HTTP-200-Statuscode bei erfolgreicher Authentifizierung zurückgeben"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:74
msgid "Return an HTTP 401 or 403 status code on failed authentication"
msgstr "Einen HTTP-401- oder 403-Statuscode bei fehlgeschlagener Authentifizierung zurückgeben"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:75
msgid ""
"Optionally include user attributes (email, display name) in the success "
"response for user account population"
msgstr "Optional Benutzerattribute (E-Mail, Anzeigename) in der Erfolgsantwort zur Befüllung des Benutzerkontos enthalten"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:76
msgid "Respond within a reasonable timeout (recommended under 10 seconds)"
msgstr "Innerhalb eines angemessenen Timeouts antworten (empfohlen unter 10 Sekunden)"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:79
msgid "API Style Details"
msgstr "API Style Details"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:81
msgid "**Form URL Encoded [GET]**"
msgstr "**Form URL Encoded [GET]**"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:83
msgid "Sends credentials as query parameters::"
msgstr "Sendet Anmeldedaten als Query-Parameter::"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:85
msgid "GET https://iam.example.com/api/authenticate?username=user&password=pass"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:87
msgid "**Form URL Encoded [POST]**"
msgstr "**Form URL Encoded [POST]**"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:89
msgid "Sends credentials as form body::"
msgstr "Sendet Anmeldedaten als Form-Body::"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:91
msgid ""
"POST https://iam.example.com/api/authenticate\n"
"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n"
"\n"
"username=user&password=pass"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:96
msgid "**JSON [POST]**"
msgstr "**JSON [POST]**"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:98
msgid "Sends credentials as JSON::"
msgstr "Sendet Anmeldedaten als JSON::"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:100
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"POST https://iam.example.com/api/authenticate\n"
"Content-Type: application/json\n"
"\n"
"{\"username\": \"user\", \"password\": \"pass\"}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:105
msgid "**XML [POST]**"
msgstr "**XML [POST]**"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:107
msgid "Sends credentials as XML::"
msgstr "Sendet Anmeldedaten als XML::"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:109
msgid ""
"POST https://iam.example.com/api/authenticate\n"
"Content-Type: application/xml\n"
"\n"
"<auth><username>user</username><password>pass</password></auth>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:114
msgid "**HTTP Basic [GET]**"
msgstr "**HTTP Basic [GET]**"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:116
msgid "Sends credentials in the Authorization header::"
msgstr "Sendet Anmeldedaten im Authorization-Header::"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:118
msgid ""
"GET https://iam.example.com/api/authenticate\n"
"Authorization: Basic dXNlcjpwYXNz"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:122
msgid "Security Considerations"
msgstr "Sicherheitsüberlegungen"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:124
msgid "Always use HTTPS for the API Endpoint to protect credentials in transit"
msgstr "Verwenden Sie für den API-Endpunkt stets HTTPS, um Anmeldedaten während der Übertragung zu schützen"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:125
msgid ""
"Use value encryption (AES or HmacSHA256) as an additional layer when the "
"API requires it"
msgstr "Verwenden Sie die Wertverschlüsselung (AES oder HmacSHA256) als zusätzliche Schicht, wenn die API dies erfordert"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:126
msgid ""
"HTTP Basic [GET] mode does not support additional value encryption "
"(credentials are Base64-encoded in the header)"
msgstr "Der Modus HTTP Basic [GET] unterstützt keine zusätzliche Wertverschlüsselung (Anmeldedaten werden Base64-kodiert im Header übertragen)"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:127
msgid "Rotate the encryption key periodically if using value encryption"
msgstr "Rotieren Sie den Verschlüsselungsschlüssel regelmäßig, wenn Sie die Wertverschlüsselung verwenden"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:128
msgid ""
"Ensure the external IAM system implements rate limiting and account "
"lockout to prevent brute-force attacks"
msgstr "Stellen Sie sicher, dass das externe IAM-System Rate Limiting und Kontosperrung implementiert, um Brute-Force-Angriffe zu verhindern"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:130
msgid "Important"
msgstr "Wichtig"

#: ../../administration/identity_sources/custom_iam_api.rst:130
msgid ""
"Custom IAM API identity source users will not authenticate in |morpheus| "
"if there is an existing |morpheus| user with a matching username or email"
" address that was not created by this identity source."
msgstr "Benutzer der Identitätsquelle Custom IAM API werden in |morpheus| nicht authentifiziert, wenn bereits ein |morpheus|-Benutzer mit übereinstimmendem Benutzernamen oder E-Mail-Adresse vorhanden ist, der nicht von dieser Identitätsquelle erstellt wurde."

